    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three, two, one - STEP ON IT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anything goes in these races: Risky overtaking manoeuvres, shameless crashes and insane pile-ups. Hurtle through deep gorges, glittering diamond caves, icy polar regions and yawning canyons. Dodge obstacles at full speed, catapult your vehicle over jumps and fire items at your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give it your all, achieve your best time and win the trophy!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 fun characters with cool vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 action-packed cups with 24 fast-paced race tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single race or tournament</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more action, even more power, even more stunts!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three, two, one - STEP ON IT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anything goes in these races: Risky overtaking manoeuvres, shameless crashes and insane pile-ups. Hurtle through deep gorges, glittering diamond caves, icy polar regions and yawning canyons. Dodge obstacles at full speed, catapult your vehicle over jumps and fire items at your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give it your all, achieve your best time and win the trophy!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 fun characters with cool vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 action-packed cups with 24 fast-paced race tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single race or tournament</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even more action, even more power, even more stunts!</p></li></ul>",
